{"id":"1fb6ef473fb89132","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-cor-borel-measurable.md","title":"Borel Measurable","display":"cor-borel-measurable — Borel Measurable","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-borel-measurable","aliases":["58-cor-borel-measurable"],"display":"cor-borel-measurable — Borel Measurable","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-borel-measurable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-borel-measurable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-borel-measurable — Borel Measurable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)\\)</span> (Carathéodory measurability, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All Borel sets are measurable.</li>\n<li>More generally, every analytic subset of a Polish space is universally measurable; nonmeasurable sets occur beyond the analytic pointclass.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)$ (Carathéodory measurability, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}borel\\text{-}measurable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)","display":true}],"bytes":1058,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-cor-borel-measurable.md|58-cor-borel-measurable]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["9375de7089953a2b","68427bc628af9b8d"]}